    {
      "Text": "Security update for gimp",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for gimp fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in gimp:\n\n- CVE-2026-96546: one-byte out-of-bounds heap read in the\n  uncompressed DDS loader (bsc#1282601)\n- CVE-2026-97185: out-of-bounds write in GIMPressionist plugin via\n  crafted preset file (bsc#1282596)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
